@startuml
title UC01 - Create Tutor (PetWise MVP)\nInfrastructure + Application + Domain

actor User as U
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "TutorController\n(infrastructure)" as C
participant "CreateTutorUseCase\n(application)" as UC
participant "TutorGateway\n(port)" as G
participant "JpaTutorRepository\n(adapter)" as A
database "SQLite DB" as DB

== Create Tutor Happy Path ==

U -> UI : Fill tutor form\n(name, email, phone)
UI -> C : POST /api/v1/tutors\nTutorCreateRequest
C -> UC : execute(command)

UC -> UC : validateName()\nvalidateEmail()\nvalidatePhone()
UC -> G : createTutor(aggregate)

G -> A : createTutor(aggregate)
A -> DB : INSERT INTO tutor(...)
DB --> A : new row with id
A --> G : persisted Tutor
G --> UC : persisted Tutor

UC --> C : TutorResponse DTO
C --> UI : 201 Created\nTutor JSON (id, name, email, phone)

== Validation Error ==

U -> UI : Submit invalid data
UI -> C : POST /api/v1/tutors
C -> UC : execute(command)
UC -> UC : detect validation errors
UC --> C : throws DomainException / Notification
C -> "ApiExceptionHandler" as H : handle(DomainException)
H --> UI : 400 Bad Request\napplication/problem+json

@enduml
